invented ANOLITH / Siltfen Chlor-Alkali EM-6.

## What this round produced

Scenario ZP — "ANOLITH / Siltfen Chlor-Alkali EM-6": a 90-cell monopolar
membrane row at 12.4 kA / 18.6 m3/h anolyte. Three heterogeneous,
individually-correct agents — VOLT (cell voltage), FLOW (anolyte
magmeter), PUR (header Cl2 GC) — each report their local loop in-spec.
The conjunction is not a membrane-integrity certificate. A pinhole in
cell C-17 lets catholyte back-migrate into the anolyte. VOLT reads
3.18 V inside 3.05-3.30 (remaining area carries extra CD). FLOW is
18.6 m3/h inside 17.0-20.0 (feed-true). PUR is 98.6 vol% inside
98.0-99.5 (89 healthy cells dilute C-17). Cell-outlet anolyte pH infers
3.92 (healthy 1.8-2.5; hold if > 2.80) but is policy-treated as a
brine-quality tag unless header Cl2 also trips (2021 noisy cell-pH
nuisance). The coordination-failure CLASS is new to this factory:
CATHOLYTE-BACK-MIGRATION CERTIFICATE OF A MEMBRANE PINHOLE. Completes
a different family than r01-r04 and staged r14-r33 (livelock /
synchrony-storm / arms-race / ring-with-no-faulty-pair /
false-consensus-endpoint / pairwise-Hurwitz / thermal-contact masquerade
/ mass-balance ghost / conservation-blind ratio-lock / stacked-dead-bands
/ drum-blind tension snag / resistance-compensated starvation /
multi-tau meniscus tilt / window-mean stripe / polarization-lookup
drying cell / motor-side certificate / tendon-compliance nullspace /
FFT-deadbanded airline / wall-reflection frozen spout / slag-skull
bridge / ghost-contact nullspace / crucible-weep pyrometer /
TMT-spatial-mean tube / kiln-inlet false-air). Here every agent is
correct, the header is looking at mixed Cl2, and the playbook's three
header confirms are not a cell-true membrane certificate.

The gate is a correct MODIFY (numeric floor: do not raise current above
12.4 kA while cell-outlet anolyte pH > 2.80 AND inferred chlorate >
4.5 g/L). TG-EM-6 strips PB-EM-6's current raise, holds 12.4 kA, runs
a 5.2 s current-step probe -8% (pinhole keeps |Delta pH| 0.05 <= 0.08;
live would move >= 0.45), and isolates C-17 after a 10.2 min gallery
human ratify. Immediate H2-in-Cl2 detonation is avoided (0 from the
draft). The PRIMARY episode nonetheless FAILS: 22 min of unmonitored
pre-t0 pinhole growth had already chlorinated the C-17 PTFE outlet
gasket. Cl2 leak at +5.4 h; 16 h outage; $1.64M designed. Reward total
-0.16 with process heads honest and world loss un-netted.

Triple-edge scar (NOTES-r14 item 4): volt.in_band -> current_raise
(0.17 commissioned -> 0.50 at illusion -> 0.25 after ACh-gated
depression) AND flow.in_band -> current_raise (0.16 -> 0.44 -> 0.22) AND
pur.in_band -> current_raise (0.15 -> 0.41 -> 0.20). Eligibility trace
e^{{-0.80/0.92}} = {aux['trace']:.5f}; eta {aux['eta1']:.5f} / {aux['eta2']:.5f} /
{aux['eta3']:.5f}; dw -0.250 / -0.220 / -0.210. Partial rollback of any pair
leaves the third at 0.50 / 0.44 / 0.41, all > 0.30 fire threshold —
fitted to fail. Coordinated depression of all three is the cure.

### Injections (all four present and disjoint)
- Cycle-1 domain: **chlor-alkali-membrane-electrolysis** — justified novel
