boiler) share industrial-process scaffolding but not brine-membrane
pinhole physics. Weighing a new failure family + cure vocabulary +
domain against those reused scaffolds:

{NOVEL_LINE}

## What ROUND 38 should add
1. FIT THE DESIGNED CONSTANTS: pinhole-growth arrival, probe error bands,
   gasket-chlorination kinetics, night-shift claim process.
