catholyte back-migration certificate**.

- Trigger: C-17 membrane pinhole plus back-migrated OH-, cell-outlet pH
  3.92, header Cl2 98.6 vol%.
- Base rate: <1% — 0.47%/campaign from a pinhole-growth MC (gallery visual
