  because the pinhole sits under the cell cover.
- Naive failure: FALSE PERMISSION. PB-EM-6 sees three in-spec header
  loops, raises 12.4->14.2 kA, H2-in-Cl2 4.2 vol%, $2.9M.
- Trajectory edit: put the pinhole in `state.fault_context`, make each
